# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Amped: Freestyle Snowboarding (4D530005), classifier-path benchmark
# (#433): drive generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself
# once play is confirmed. Downhill play: hold forward lean down the slope,
# steer with LX, trick/jump on A -- never START.
drive generic 300 mark
axis LY min
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 1.2
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.5
    axis LX min
    wait 1.2
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.0
    press A 300
    wait 2.0
}
